:ruby
  Card = import("/components/UI/Card")

%Card
  :markdown
    This demo needs Postgres. From the `example/` directory:

    ```sh
      podman compose up -d
      cp .env.example .env.local
      bin/db migrate
    ```

    Then restart the server.

:css
  Card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;

    & > * {
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
